<p class="mu" style="margin:0 0 12px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#5c5c58">The link works for an hour. If you didn&#39;t sign up, you can ignore this email.</p>
