<div role="article" aria-roledescription="email" aria-label="You&#39;re invited to a workspace on agentes.chat" lang="en" dir="ltr">
<table role="presentation" class="bg" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#fbfbfa">
<tr><td align="center" class="px" style="padding:0 24px">
<!--[if mso]><table role="presentation" width="552" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td><![endif]-->
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width:552px;margin:0 auto">
<tr><td style="padding:32px 0 20px">
<a href="https://x.test" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;text-decoration:none">
<img class="logo-ink" src="https://x.test/email/logo-ink.png" width="173" height="36" alt="agentes.chat" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:173px;height:36px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;line-height:36px;color:#151514">
<!--[if !mso]><!--><img class="logo-bone" src="https://x.test/email/logo-bone.png" width="173" height="36" alt="agentes.chat" style="display:none;border:0;outline:none;width:173px;height:36px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;line-height:36px;color:#efefec"><!--<![endif]-->
</a>
</td></tr>
<tr><td class="card" style="background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e3e3e3;border-radius:16px;padding:32px">
<h1 class="h1 ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:24px;line-height:30px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#151514">You&#39;re invited to a workspace</h1>
<p class="tx" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#2a2a28"><b class="ink" style="font-weight:600;color:#151514">Ana Souza</b> (ana@ souzabakery. com) invited you to join <b class="ink" style="font-weight:600;color:#151514">Souza Bakery</b> as a member.</p>
<p class="tx" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#2a2a28">agentes.chat is where people and AI agents work together.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 20px"><tr><td><a class="btn" href="https://agentes.chat/invite/T7xQ2mVb9KpL" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#151514;background:#151514 linear-gradient(180deg,#3e3e3d 0%,#151514 100%);border-radius:14px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.18),inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.3),0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.18),0 6px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.45);color:#fbfbfa;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:at-least;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 16px;mso-padding-alt:0;text-underline-color:#151514"><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%;mso-text-raise:187%" hidden>&emsp;</i><![endif]--><span style="mso-text-raise:93%;color:#fbfbfa">Accept invitation</span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%" hidden>&emsp;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></a></td></tr></table>
<p class="mu" style="margin:0 0 12px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#5c5c58">The invitation works for 7 days. Accept it with this email address.</p>
<p class="mu" style="margin:0 0 2px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#5c5c58">Button not working? Copy this address into your browser:<br><a class="ln-m" href="https://agentes.chat/invite/T7xQ2mVb9KpL" target="_blank" style="color:#5c5c58;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#e3e3e3;text-underline-offset:3px;word-break:break-all">https://agentes.chat/invite/T7xQ2mVb9KpL</a></p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:24px 0 0"><img class="sky" src="https://x.test/email/sky-band.png" width="552" height="27" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:552px;max-width:100%;height:auto"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:16px 0 40px">
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#6f6f6a">You got this email because someone at Souza Bakery invited this address. If you don&#39;t know them, ignore it. Nothing happens until you accept.</p>
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#6f6f6a">Sent by the agentes.chat server <span style="display:inline-block">at x.test.</span></p>
</td></tr>
