<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#6f6f6a">You got this email because you created this invitation, or manage the members of Souza Bakery.</p>
