</a>
</td></tr>
<tr><td class="card" style="background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e3e3e3;border-radius:16px;padding:32px">
<h1 class="h1 ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:24px;line-height:30px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#151514">You&#39;re invited to an event</h1>
<table width="100%" class="well" role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#f3f3f0;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 20px"><tr><td style="padding:4px 16px">
<table width="100%" role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr>
<td class="mu" valign="top" style="padding:10px 12px 10px 0;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#5c5c58">Event</td>
<td class="ink" valign="top" align="right" style="padding:10px 0;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;color:#151514;text-align:right">Weekly menu review</td>
</tr><tr>
<td class="mu wh" valign="top" style="padding:10px 12px 10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e4e4e1;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#5c5c58">When</td>
<td class="ink wh" valign="top" align="right" style="padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e4e4e1;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;color:#151514;text-align:right">Oct 28, 2026 at 9:00 AM GMT-3</td>
</tr><tr>
<td class="mu wh" valign="top" style="padding:10px 12px 10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e4e4e1;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#5c5c58">Workspace</td>
<td class="ink wh" valign="top" align="right" style="padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e4e4e1;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;color:#151514;text-align:right">Souza Bakery</td>
</tr><tr>
<td class="mu wh" valign="top" style="padding:10px 12px 10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e4e4e1;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#5c5c58">Invited by</td>
<td class="ink wh" valign="top" align="right" style="padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e4e4e1;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;color:#151514;text-align:right">Ana Souza</td>
</tr></table></td></tr></table>
<table class="end-btn" role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 6px"><tr><td><a class="btn" href="https://agentes.chat/org/6f1d2c9a-58c1-4f7e-9d3b-2a7c1e0b9f44/calendar?open=4c0a&amp;day=2026-10-28" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#151514;background:#151514 linear-gradient(180deg,#3e3e3d 0%,#151514 100%);border-radius:14px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.18),inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.3),0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.18),0 6px 14px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.45);color:#fbfbfa;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:at-least;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 16px;mso-padding-alt:0;text-underline-color:#151514"><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%;mso-text-raise:187%" hidden>&emsp;</i><![endif]--><span style="mso-text-raise:93%;color:#fbfbfa">See the event</span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%" hidden>&emsp;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></a></td></tr></table>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:24px 0 0"><img class="sky" src="https://x.test/email/sky-band.png" width="552" height="27" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:552px;max-width:100%;height:auto"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:16px 0 40px">
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#6f6f6a">You got this email because someone at Souza Bakery invited you to an event.</p>
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#6f6f6a">Sent by the agentes.chat server <span style="display:inline-block">at x.test.</span></p>
</td></tr>
</table>
<!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
</td></tr>
</table>
</div>
</body>
</html>"
`;

