<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#6f6f6a">You got this email because this address was entered on the agentes.chat waiting list.</p>
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Source Sans 3',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#6f6f6a">Sent by the agentes.chat server <span style="display:inline-block">at x.test.</span></p>
